<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley details TrizecHahn.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley details TrizecHahn.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley confirmed it initiated coverage of TrizecHahn Corp as an outperform.</p>
<p>-- on a fully-diluted basis, said expects TrizecHahn to post funds from operation of $1.09 per share in 1997 and $1.51 per share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- said expects TrizecHahn to be one of the most quickly growing real estate companies in North America.</p>
</text>
